@startuml
title ide-tui -- T3 component relationships (syntax highlighting)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "crates/tui" {
  component "app.rs\nopen_or_focus_tab" as App
  component "ui.rs\nstyled_line / style_for" as Ui
}

package "ide-core" {
  component "syntax_for_path" as SyntaxForPath
  component "Buffer::set_syntax" as SetSyntax
  component "TextBuffer::apply\n(incremental retokenize)" as Apply
  component "TextBuffer::tokens_in_lines" as TokensInLines
  component "TokenKind / Token" as TokenKind
}

App --> SyntaxForPath : resolve from path\n(tab-open time)
App --> SetSyntax : install rules once
SetSyntax --> Apply : every later edit\nretokenizes incrementally
Ui --> TokensInLines : per line, per frame
TokensInLines --> TokenKind : returns overlapping tokens\n(may cross line boundary)
Ui --> TokenKind : style_for(kind)

note right of Ui
  styled_line clamps each token's
  absolute byte range to the current
  line's own [line_start, line_end]
  before slicing line_text -- a block
  comment token can legitimately span
  multiple lines.
end note

note bottom of App
  Same syntax_for_path + set_syntax
  pattern crates/ui/src/app.rs's
  Tab::from_buffer already uses.
end note
@enduml
